<title>USA: ValuJet mechanics win tentative wage pact.</title>
<headline>ValuJet mechanics win tentative wage pact.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>About 120 unionized mechanics and inspectors at ValuJet Inc won a tentative agreement that would raise their wages by almost 30 percent over the next three and a half years, the Teamsters union said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The International Brotherhood of Teamsters said the pact covered workers in Atlanta; Fort Lauderdale, Fla.; and at Washington's Dulles International Airport.</p>
